<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa Asuntsis Xaafide Lam7intsa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Qoro.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Lam7intsa Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa asuntsis xaafide lam7intsa kiita xaafinttidanna, ees Qoronttoosa woosa keetstsara yeze yellintta gaama madha gidda gelii yeze wode. Fettii fettii woosa keetstsa asuntsi Phawuloosa iita bore borikon Phawuloosa giigisades ees amotitsi yezanno beezida. Yinna hyanize wode damma ufayssi ufayttodes dandda7izanno qonccizane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa fa kiita tiino kifilite, Qoronttoosa woosa keetstsara ees yeze yellintto qonccizi, woosa keetsite medhinttide bortisin ixxizannis akkos mintsi mahe inggezako ohine. Yinnira yeltsi E seerita unttana nagarappa mahi giiges yeltside gisho E ufayttide ufayssito unttis qonccizane. Mahin, Yihuda yeze ammanze asuntsana maaddodes faas yeze bazappa hyarii immade gaar qoppizane. Wurssutsi zofantte Phawuloosa fa hawaaretitsitilla afa denddide moottis mahe inggane. Mikinaatan, Qoronttoosa woosa keetsite yeze fettii fettii asuntsi fana, «Turii hawaare» mahi, «Phawuloosa worddanchcho hawaare» mahi mootane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosan Qoronttoosa woosa keetstsa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:12-7:16">1:12—7:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihuda yeze ammanze asuntsi maade <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1—9:15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa fa hawaaretitsi adetits wolqqas inggide mahe</para>
  <para style="io1">Xaatsi qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 13:11-14">13:11-14</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Xoozze qofara Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaare maaqqide Phawuloosan, nu ishe Ximotiyoosa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Qoronttoosa gidda yeze Xoozze woosa keetsitisin Akkaya gade yeze Xoozze as ubbuntsis xaafide kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Hawa. 18:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Xoozze nu Adeppan Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosappa, aadho keehatitsin sarotitsi yinttis maaqqe.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Xooz galatane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Maarotits Ades, ubba wode nuna mintsitsize Xoozzes, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa Ades galata maaqqe. <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Xoozii nuus inggide mintsitsite, madha yezuntsana nu mintsitsode fana Xoozii nuna nu madhite ubba mintsitsane. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosara gaama madhite shaakkinttidanni gaara mahi nuunii E gaama mintsitsite minggoda. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Nuunii madha ekkiko yinna yinttana mintsitsodesin yinttana ashshodes. Mahi nuunii miinggiko nuunii genccide madhiti fana yinttin gencci, Xoozii yinttis inggize mintsitsite minggoda. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Yin nu ekkide madhiti gaar ekkii, nu mintsitsite shaakkinttodanno nu erize gisho nu ufayssita yin gidda mintsi.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Nu ishuntso, Isiya gade nuna yellide madhito yin erode gaar koyane. Yinna nuna yellide madhita nu wolqqitippa deexxin, hyayqqikaayzara attoos ga7i ufayssi gachchida yeshsha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Qoro. 15:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Nuunii nuulla hyayqo firdda firddinttide fana qoppida. Yezin nuunii nu ommite maaqqikaayzin, hyayqqiduntsana dentsize Xoozzalla ammaninttode gaar yinna yi7ida. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Xoozii yinnii gaar iita hyayqoppa nuna ashshida; hyatten ashshoda; tiinosin E nuna ashshoda ga7i E gidda ufayssi gaddane. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>Woosara nuna maaddote. Gaama woosa baggara Xoozze maade nu denggize wode gaama asuntsi nu gisho Xooz galatane.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa qitodes qoppide qoftto laammida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Nuunii nu geeshi wozintte ceeqinttane. Nuunii hyanna alamite yezide yestte aatsii nu yezide yestte turetitsaran suuretitsara yinttara yezida. Yinnan, hyanna alame cinccatitsite maaqqikaayzin Xoozze aadho keehatitsite. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Nu yinttis xaafide dabddaabiza yin nabbabodesin qoppodes dandda7izebaz fattin melle baaya. Yin eza qoppodes dandda7izanno ta ammanane. <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>Hyatte yin nu baz eeratsar erane, yezin tiinos loytsii erodanno ta ammaninttane. Nu Laatstse Yesuusa maaqqize wode nuunii yin gidda ceeqinttidanni fana yinttin nu gidda ceeqinttoda.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Yinno taanii loytsii eride gisho yin lam7intsa maaddinttode gaar tiinidhii yinttago hyammades qofa accida. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Taanii Maqedooniya hyanggi yeygappa maaqqii yinttana be7ada. Taanii yeygappa Yihuda hyanggize wode yin tana moyzoda ga7i qoppida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Hawa. 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Taanii yinno ga7ite akko oochchodes beezzako eroosse as aazane? Woy taanii ta qoftto accize wode as qofa gaar, fettii tohe «Yee» mahi fettii tohe «Ade» gaaze as aazanene?<verse eid="2CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Yezin Xoozii ammaninttizaya maaqqide gisho nu yinttis ohize qaaltta «Yee» woy «Ade» gaazanno baaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Taanin, Sillaasen Ximotiyoosan yinttis markkidhide Xoozze Na7i, Yesuus Kiristtoosa ubba wode «Yee» fattin «Yee» ran «Adera» baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Hawa. 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Xoozii inggoda gayde ubba Kiristtoosa baggara «Yee» maaqqane. Nuunii Kiristtoosa baggara Xoozza bonchchoda, «Amin77e» gaazanna yinnii gisho. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Nuunin yin Kiristtoosa gidda miinggi eqqode gaar fa oochitis dooride Xoozii. <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>Nuunii E baz maaqqidanno erisodes fa mahitamito nuulla gaddida; mahi fa Geeshi Ayyaana qabde mahi nu wozintte gaddida.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Taanii Qoronttoosa hyanggikaayzara attidanna yin azzanikaayzara attaame gishos; yinna worddo maaqqiko Xoozii ta shemppito taappa ekko. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Yin, yin ammantte miinggi yeze gisho nu yinttana ufayssodes yinttara wolla oochchizuntsana fattin yinttana wolqqara ammantsizuntsana baaya.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Taanii lam7intsa yinttago hyanggoos ga7i qofa accidanna yinttana azzantsikaayzara attaama. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Taanii yinttana azzantsikon ta azzantsiduntsi yinttappa melle tana ufayssodes yeze oode? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Taanii yinttis ye dabddaabiza xaafidanna, ta yinttana be7ades hyanggize wode tana ufayssodes beezize asuntsalla ta azzanodes koyoose gisho. Ta ufayttize wode yin ubbuntsin ufayttodanno ta ammanane. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Taanii gaama waayen un7an mahi gaama afutstsara xaafidanna, yinttana azzantsodes maaqqikaayzin taanii yinttana ubba akko gaar kadhizako yinttana erisode fana.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qohidaya maare baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Asi azzantside ooden yeziko ta eella afa gantsodes koyoos fattin tana maaqqikaayzin yinttappa gaamuntsana azzantsida. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Yinttappa gaama asuntsi ye atstsa seeride seeretsita ees maaqqada. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Yinnii gisho, ye atstse gaama azzanii, ufayssi gachchaame fana cer yin eza maarodesin mintsitsodes beezane. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Yin eza siiqizanno mahi ees qonccissade fana ta yinttana woossane. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Ta ye dabddaabiza yinttis xaafidanna, yin fattanintti, ubba baza taas kiitinttizanno erodes koyde gisho. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Yin maarize atstsa taanin maaroda. Taanii maarodebaz akko yezikon, Kiristtoosa tiino yin gisho ga7i maarida. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Ta yinno oochchidanna Xalahe gene oocha nu erize gisho xalahe cimmaame fana.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xiro7aada Phawuloosa un7intto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Taanii Kiristtoosa Wonggele sabbakodes Xiro7aada hyanggide wode Laatstsii ize taas oocha oge giigizii gaddida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Hawa. 20:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Yezin taanii ta ishe Tito ize denggikaayze gisho ta wozintta shemppikaaya. Yinnii gisho, ize yeze asuntsana sarotsi eza koyodes Maqedooniya qitida.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Yezin Kiristtoosa baggara ubba wode nuna gamera kaalitsizayan shitto fana sawize Kiristtoosa baz nu erize timirttito ubba bessa yeltsode gaar oochchize Xoozza galata yello. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Nuunii attize asunts giddan dhabize asunts gidda Kiristtoosa baggara Xoozis ingginttide sawize shitto fana. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Dhabize asuntsis hyayqos kanggize hyayqo zeeqo; mahi attize asuntsis de7ogo kanggize de7o sawo; yeezin, yinnii gaarize oochas beezize as maaqqade oode? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Nuunii Xoozze qaala tirfe denggodes koyi buqutsi zal77ize gaama asunts gaar baaya. Yezin Xoozii kiittide luule asunts fana Kiristtoosa gidda yezii Xoozze tiintte qaala ohine.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kille caaqo oochanchchuntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Nuunii mahi nuna nashshonene? Woy melle as gaar, galata dabddaabiza yinttis dakkodes woy yinttappa ekkodes nuna koshshanene? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Asi ubba yinttana erode fanan nabbabode fana yin nu wozintte yeze dabddaabbe. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Yin qalamera maaqqikaayzin de7o Xoozze Ayyaanara, shuchchalla afa maaqqikaayzin as wozina xaafinttiduntsanan nuura maadinttide Kiristtoosa dabddaabbe maaqqizanno beezida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Keze 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Er. 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Hiz. 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26">36:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Nu yinno gaydanna, Kiristtoosa baggara Xoozze gidda ammano nuus yeze gisho. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Nu yinno oochchodes dandda7idanna Xoozze wolqqara fattin nuunii nu wolqqara akkon oochchodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>Nu kille caaqos kiitinttizuntsana maaqqade fana nuna yiizida. Yinna kille caaqita Geeshi Ayyaanara benttida fattin xaafinttide higge gidda baaya. Higge wodhane, yezin Geeshi Ayyaana de7o inggane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Er. 31:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Shuchchalla afa xaafinttide higgita ingginttide wode Xoozze bonchchita qonccida. Muse sintte yeze bonchchita dhabiter hyanggizebaz maaqqikon, Isra7eele asuntsi E sintto dakkii be7ades un dandda7ikaaya. Yikke, hyayqo ki7ize higge yinnii gaar bonchchora qoncciko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Keze 34:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>yeezin, Geeshi Ayyaanara oochinttize oocha bonchchita wayzi aadhooso? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Asalla afa firdda ki7ize higge bonchcho maaqqiko yeezin, asi xillize kille oge wayzi aadhii bonchchinttosa? <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Zaga bonchcho maaqqidanno hyatte aadhize bonchchora yeltsi be7ize wode zaganna bonchcho baayze baz maaqqida. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Eerats wodes benttii suubappa dhabidanna hyannii fana bonchchinttiko, medhina yezanna wayzi aadhii bonchchinttoso?<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Nuus hyannii gaar ufayssi yeze gisho yeellidhikaayzara ohine. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Nuunii, Isra7eele asuntsi dhabiter hyanggize bonchchiti folito ba7aame gaar fa sintto goozide Muse fana baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Keze 34:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Yezin un wozintta doccida. Hyayno yellodes un gal77a caaqo nabbabize wode un wozintta yinna goozite goozinttii yene. Yinna goozita Kiristtoosar xalaala gaarinttane. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Yezin hyayno yellodes un Muse maxaafe nabbabize wode ubba yinna goozita un wozintto goozane. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Yezin ooden Laatstsago maaqqize wode ayden yinna goozita gaarinttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Keze 34:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Laatstsii Ayyaana; Laatstse Ayyaana yeze besite wallotitsi yene. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Nuunii ubbuntsi goozinttikaayze sinora Laatstse bonchchito be7ada.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Be7ada: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masttoote fana mahi beessada ga7i bilinttodes dandda7ane.</char></note> Nuunii Ayyaana maaqqide Laatstse bishshito aazodes bonchchoppa bonchcho laaminttoda.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Turii hawaaretitsi oocha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Yikke, Xoozii fa maarotitsite hyanna oochito nuus inggide gisho nuunii ufayssi gachchoos. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Nuunii aachichan yeellize oocha ubba ashshida; gene oocha oochchoos; Xoozze qaala worddora worqqoos. Turtto qoncce ohite, as ubba wozina nuna ekkode fana Xoozze tiino nuna shiishoda.<verse eid="2CO 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Nu ohize Wonggelize geenggide baz maaqqikon, genggidanna dhabe oge yeze asuntsis. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Hyanna alamito ahize xoozze ammanoose asunts wozintto goozida. Un Xoozze bishshara qonccide Kiristtoosa bonchcho Wonggele foo7ito be7aame gaar kayda. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Nuunii, Yesuus Kiristtoosa Laatstsi maaqqidannon nu E gisho yin oochanchcho maaqqizanno ohine fattin nu baz ohoos. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>«Foo7o dhuma gidda foo7o» gayde Xoozze, Kiristtoosa sintto foo7ize Xoozze bonchchito erize foo7ito inggodes fa foo7ito nu wozintte foo7izida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Medho 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Yezin ubbappa aadhize wolqqa nu baz maaqqikaayzin Xoozze baz maaqqizanno beessades hyanna bonchcho qoltta meqqize miishe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Meqqize miishe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyanna besite meqqize miishe ga7inttidanna sa7appa medhinttide miishe beessades: ota, shaate, beshe. </char></note> fana nu gidda yene.<verse eid="2CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Nu ubba baggara waayinttida, yezin meqqikaaya. Nuus workkita maaqqida, yezikon ufayssi gachchikaaya. <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Nu, morkkuntsara bay7inttida, yezin lagge dhabikaaya. Nu morkkuntsara guudunttii gol7ida, yezin dhabikaaya. <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Yesuusa ye7ita nu gallite qonccode fana E hyayqito ubba wode nu gallite tookkii wutane. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Yesuusa de7ita hyayqqize nu gallite qonccode gaar faxa yeze nuunii E gisho ubba wode hyayqos aadhii ingginttane. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Yikke, hyayqo nu gidda oochchize wode de7o yinggida oochchane.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, «Ta ammanida; yinnii gisho ohida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Maz. 116:10</ref></char></note>yaga7inttida. Yinnii fana ammano nuus yeze gisho ohine. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Laatstse Yesuusa hyayqoppa dentside Xoozze, nunan Yesuusara hyayqoppa dentsodannon yinttara wolla fa tiino shiishodanno erane. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Yinna ubba hyanidanna yin gisho. Xoozze aadho keehatitsita gaama asuntsana yellize wode asuntsi Xoozze bonchchos galata gaanggode fana.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanora yeze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Yinnii gisho, nuunii ufayssi gachchoos. Nu benttize galtta labbitera hyanggizebaz maaqqikon, nu ayyaana gallita qammite qammite killidhdhane. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Hyattes nu madhinttize hyanna laafa madhita, ubbappa aadhii dammize medhina bonchcho nuus inggissada. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Nuunii benttize baz maaqqikaayzin benttoosse baz be7ine. Benttize baz hyattes, yezin benttoosse baz medhinas.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Hyatte nu yeze dunkkaane aazize hyanna sa7a ashita wul7inttikon, asi keexikaayze, Xoozii keexxide medhina keetstsi nuus salo yezanno erane. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Salo galla ma77odes amudhdhitera hyatte hyanna sa7ite yezitera sheenidhane. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Nuunii yinno ma77ide wode kallidhoos. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Dunkkaane aazize hyanna sa7a ashite nu yezitera deexxin sheenidhane. Hyayqqize nu ashita de7or laaminttode fana salo galla ma77odes koyane fattin ashoppa shaakkinttodes koyi baaya. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Nuna hyannis giigizide Xoozii. Mahi tiinoppa yo7ode bazis qabde mahi fa Ayyaantto nuus inggida.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Yinnii gisho, nuunii hyanna sa7a ashtira yeze wode ubba Laatstsappa hyaakkii yezanno erikon ubba wode ammaninttii yene. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Nuunii yeze ammanora fattin be7ize bazara baaya. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Nu hyanna sa7a ashtippa shaakkintti, Laatstsara wolla yessades amudhdhize gisho ammaninttii yene. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Yinnii gisho, nu hyanna ashtira yezin woy hyanna ashtippa shaakkinttin, nu amotitsita eza ufayssodes. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Nuunii fete fete hyanna sa7ite yezitera lo77o maaqqikon woy iita maaqqikon, oochchide oochitis beezize firdda ekkodes Kiristtoosa firdda oyda tiino shiiqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Rome 14:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asi Xoozara giigize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Yikke, nuunii Laatstses zhashtizanna akkos yezako erize gisho asuntsi nu ohizanno ekkode fana zorane. Xoozii, nuunii ood yezako nuna erane; mahi yinttin yin wozintte nu ood yezako erane yaga7i qoppane. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Wozina gidda maaqqikaayzin cer hyarii ceeqinttize asuntsis mahe yin immades dandda7ode gaar yin nu gidda ceeqinttode gaar yinttis mikinaate maaqqades koyane fattin nu nuna mahi nashshodes koyoos. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Nu zhaashtiza maaqqiko Xoozze bonchchos; wozinaama maaqqiko yinttis. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Fete ubbuntsis hyayqqidayan ubbuntsi mahi eera hyayqqidanno nu erize gisho Kiristtoosa siiqita nuna ahane. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>De7o yezuntsi yikkeppa suuba faas maaqqikaayzin unttis hyayqqidesin hyayqoppa denddides yessade fana Kiristtoosa as ubba gisho hyayqqida.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Yikkeppa suuba, nuunii oonan as qofara firddoos. Hyannippa zaga nuunii Kiristtoosan as qofa gaar firddide baz maaqqikon, yikkeppa yinnii gaara firddoos. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Yinnii gisho, ooden Kiristtoosa gidda yeziko kille medho; gal77a medhetitsita aadhida; ubba kille maaqqida. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Yinno ubba Xoozii oochchida. E Kiristtoosa baggara nuna faara giigizida. Mahi melluntsana faara giigissade gaar nuus giigiza oocha inggida. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Xoozii Kiristtoosa baggara as ubba faara giigizane. Un nagartto faydikaaya; mahi asi faara giigize qaala nuus inggida.<verse eid="2CO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Xoozii asmana nu baggara xeegize gisho nu Kiristtoosas kiitinttide as gaar Xoozara giigote ga7i Kiristtoosa gisho woossane. <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Nuunii Xoozze xillotitsi Kiristtoosa baggara ekkode gaar, nagara eroossa Kiristtoosa nu gisho nagaranchcho asi fana mahida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Nagaranchcho asi fana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nagaras zharsho mahida. </char></note><verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Nuunii Xoozara wolla oochchize as maaqqidanni gaar, yin ekkide aadho keehatitsito cer mahaame fana nu yinttana woossane. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Xoozii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">«Wottide saate ta nena si7ida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">atotits qammite nena maaddida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">yagaane. Yikke, si7ize wodita hyatte; atotits qammita hyayno.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa. 49:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Ooden nu oochito borode gaaran nu gidda dhubunttode gaar koyoos. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Yezin, nu turii Xoozze oochanchcho maaqqidanno nu oochchize ubba bazite beessada; Gaama madhara, waayeran, un7ara, <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>garafinttera, acinttera, ixintter kumide kachchara, oochchi labbera, gentto dhabera, nayera,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Hawa. 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>geeshshatitsara, eratitsara, dandda7ara, keehatitsara, Geeshi Ayyaanara, turii siiqora, <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>turii qaalara Xoozze wolqqara nuunii E oochanchcho maaqqidanno beezida. Mahi xillotitsi nuus tooran gonddalle. <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Nuunii bonchchinttidan borinttida; cazhinttidan galatinttida. Turo ohine, yezin asuntsi nuna balitsizuntsana gayda. <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Nu as gidda erinttide asi, yezin erinttoosse as gaar maaqqida. Hyayqqida ga7inttida, yezin faxa yene; guuddinttida, yezin hyayqqikaaya. <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Nuunii azzanikon ubba wode ufayttane. Nu daha yeshsha, yezin gaama asuntsana durizane. Mahi akko baayze as yeshsha, yezin ubbanna nu baz.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Qoronttoosa asuntso, nu yinttis geeshi ohida; nu wozintto yinttana beezida. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Yin nuna yin siiqito beezanxi kaydap attin nu nu siiqito yinttana kaykaaya. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Ade fa na7untsis ohizannifana ta yinttis ohine; nu yinttana nu wozintto beezidanni fana, yinttin yin wozintto nuna beezote.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanoose asuntsara yeze fettetitsito ashshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Ammanoose asuntsara beezoosse ogera waaxinttippete. Xillotitsisin nagarasin akko yellintte yeze? Foo7osin dhumasin akko fettetitsi yeze? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Kiristtoosan Xalahen yeltsizebaz akko? Mahi ammanzayin ammanoosayin wolla koxxizebaz akko? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Xoozze Keetsisin eequntsara akko fettetitsi yeze? Xoozii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">«Ta un gidda yessada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ta un gidda benttoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Ta unttis Xooz maaqqada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">unttin ta worzha maaqqada»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:16">gaydannigaara, nuunii de7o Xoozze keetstsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Leewe 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Hiz. 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Qoro. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">6:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Yinnii gisho, Laatstsii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">«Un giddappa shaakkintti kezote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">tuna maaqqide baz bochchippete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ta yinttana ekkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa. 52:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Ta yinttis ade maaqqada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">yin taas dhiiratsi na7untsanan maachi na7untsanan maaqqada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">yagaane Ubbappa wolqqaama Laatstsay» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Zeena 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa. 43:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Er. 31:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Yikke, ta siiquntso, hyanna ufayssita nuus maaqqide gisho nu ashton nu shemppito tunize baz ubbappa nuna geeshoda. Xoozis zhashtii nu geeshshatitsito folo mahoda.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa ufays</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Yin wozintto nuna beezote. Nuunii oonan qohikaaya; oodesin iissikaaya; oonan cimmikaaya. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Taanii yinno yinttalla afa firddodes ga7oos. Hyannippa tiino ta yinttis ohidanni gaara, yin nu wozintte yene; nu faxa yezikon hyayqqikon yinttappa shaakkinttoos. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Yinttalla taas yeze ammantta damma; ta yinttara minggane; nu madhite ubba wode ufayttane.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Nuunii Maqedooniya yellide wode ubba baggara waayinttida fattin shemppikaaya. Balera morkkuntsara, giddar zhashmora un7inttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:13">2 Zeena 2:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Yezin azzaniduntsana mintsitsize Xoozze, Tito ye7ite nuna mintsitsida. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Nuna mintsitsize Tito ye7ito xalaala maaqqikaayzin yinttin eza mintsitsidanno si7idanne gujjii. Yin tana amudhizanno, taas azzanzanno taas qoppizanno ta si7ide wode tana gaama ufayssida.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Ta dabddaabbize yinttana azzantsikon akkos ta xaafine ga7i qiiridhdhoos. Ta qiiridhdhidanna ta dabddaabbize yinttana eerats wodes azzantside gisho. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Hyatte taanii ufayttidanna, ta yinttana azzantside gisho maaqqikaayzin yin azzantta yinttana yin nagarttippa mahide gisho. Xoozii fa qoftti gaar yinttana azzantsida fattin nu yinttana akko bazaran qohikaaya. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Xoozii koyze azzano, atotitsago yeltsize nagarappa maaqqe ke7ine; E gidda qiirizebaz baaya. Yezin hyanna sa7a azzantta hyayqo ke7ine. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Yin azzantta yin gidda aafizide aafito bo7ote. Yinna azzantta yinttana akko gaar dentsitsezako akko gaar mahe inggezako, akko gaar ellisii kaccizako, akko gaar zhashizezako, akko gaar suukizezako, akko gaar taas qanaatezako, akko gaar seeritsi kaalitsizako bo7ote. Hyanna ubbanne yin geeshi maaqqizanno markkidhizida.<verse eid="2CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Yinnii gisho, taanii hyay dabddaabbiza yinttis xaafidanna, qohize atstsa woy naaqqinttide atstse gisho baaya. Yezin yin nuus akko gaar qoppizako Xoozze tiino yin, yinttana be7ade gaar xaafida. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Nuunii miinggidannippa aadhii Tito denggidanne ufayttida. Nu ufayttidanna aadhii, yin Tito ufayssidannen E wozintto shemppizidanne. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Taanii yinttana nashshii ees ohin yin tana yeellizikaaya. Yinnii gisho nuunii ubba wode yinttis turo ohine; yinnii gaara nuunii Tito tiino yinttana nashshidanna turo maaqqida. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>Yin ees zhashimora goqii, eza mokkidanno mahi ees akko gaar kiitinttezako E qoppize wode yinttis yeze siiqita miinggite hyanggida. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Taanii ubba baza yin gidda ammaninttize gisho ufayttane.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ingge baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Nu ishuntso, Xoozii Maqedooniya yeze woosa keetsuntsis inggide aadho keehatitsito yin erode gaar nu koyane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Rome 15:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Un damma madhara fattaninttida, yezin un ufayssita wolqqaama. Un dahatitsitis wuzula baaya, yezin aatsii inggera gaama dalggida. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Un fa wolqqiti gaaran fa wolqqitippa aadhizanno kadhii inggidannis ta markka. <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>Un Xooz asi maaddize lo77o oocha nuura oochchodes koyi nuna gaama woossida. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Un nuunii qoppidannippa aatsii oochchida. Tiinidhii fana Laatstsis inggida; kaallii, Xoozze qofa gaar un fana nuus inggida.<verse eid="2CO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Hyanna dalgga oochito aykkide Tito gujjii oochchode gaaran yinttana maaddii, yinna oochito folisade gaar eza woossida. <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Yezin yin ubbabazite, ammanora, ohera, eratitsara, damma amora, nuna siiqoran ubbabazite duridhdhidanni fana hyanna lo77o oochiten yin dalgga maaqqade gaar nu koyane.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Taanii yinno kiittodes ga7oos. Yezin melluntsi damma amuto yin siiqora yeltsi bi7i yin akko fana turo yezako erodes gaane. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Yin nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsito erane. Kiristtoosa dure maaqqii bettii, yin E dahatitsite duridhdhade gaar yin gisho dahidhida.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Taanii hyanna ohite yinttana maaddize zore zorodes koyane. Yin omatse bere immades xalaala maaqqikaayzin yinno oochchodes amotitsaran yin tiinane. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Yin oochchodes aykkide oochito hyatte folote. Yin yinttis yezanni gaar inggiko, yinna yin inggodes qoppidanno turo mahine. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Fettii asi inggodes amudhdhiko, E imota Xoozze tiino ekinttizanna, E faas yezanni fana inggiko fattin baayze bazappa inggodes un7inttin baaya.<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Taanii yinno gaazanna, yin ubbanna fettii likke maaqqade gaar ga7i fattin melluntsi madhitippa shemppin yin madhidhade gaar baaya. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Yin madhidhize wode unttis gaanggidannippa yin madhitis maaqqade fana hyatte yinttis gaanggidanna un madhitis feezhane. Yinnii fana yin gidda wolkke maaqqada. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, «Gaama shiishides tirfikaaya; eerats shiishides faccikaaya» ga7intti xaafinttidanni gaar.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Keze 16:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Titon E lagguntsana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Nu yinttis qoppizannigaara Titon yinttis qoppode gaar oochchide Xoozze galatintto. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Tito yinttago hyanggidanna, nu eza dentsitside gisho xalaala maaqqikaayzin E fa qofite hyammades amudhdhide gisho. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Wonggele markkidhera woosa keetstsa ubbanne gaama erinttide isha, nuunii Titora dakkane. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Yinnilla nuunii hyanna dalgga imotitsito kanggize wode nuura hyammade gaar hyanna dalgga oochitira Laatstsa bonchchodesin melluntsana maaddodes yeze amuto beessades E woosa keetsite doorinttida.<verse eid="2CO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Hyanna ingginttide dalgga imotitsito, nu oochalla feeshize wode nuna boraame fana naaginttoda. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Nuunii Laatstse tiino xalaala maaqqikaayzin as tiinon lo77o maaqqide baz oochchoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Aazi. 3:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Mahi gaama wode faatana gidda miinggi aadhide nu isha, unttara yinttago dakkida. E yinggida loytsii ammaninttize gisho hyatte yinttana maaddodes gaama amudhdhane. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Titobaz erodes koyzako, E yinttana maaddodes taara oochchize ta oocha lagge. Melle ishuntsbaz maaqqiko woosa keetsuntsi kiittiduntsana; mahi asuntsi un yestto bi7i Kiristtoosa bonchchane. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Yinnii gisho, woosa keetsita yin siiqiton nu yinttana ammaninttizanna turo maaqqidanno beessades yin siiqito hyantsi asuntsana beezote.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammanze asuntsis kessize miishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Ammanze asuntsis kessize miishebaz ta yinttis xaafodes koshshoos. <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Yin maaddodes loytsii amudhdhizanno ta erane. Yin Akkaya asuntsi, omatse bereppa aykkii maaddodes giiginttidanno taanii Maqedooniya asuntsis doona kuntsi ohida. Yin damma amotitsita unttappa gaamuntsana dentsitsida. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Hyanna oochite yin gidda nu ceeqinttize ceeqita hyarii maaqqaame gaar tiino yin baz ta ohidanni gaara yin giiginttii naagode gaar hyantsi ishuntsana yinttago kiittida. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Maqedooniya asuntsi taara hyanggi, yin giiginttikaayzar yessader, denggiko, nu yin gidda yeellidhada; mahi yin nuuppa aadhii yeellidhada. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Yinnii gisho, hyantsi ishuntsi taappa tiinidhii yinttago hyanggi, yin inggoda gayde imotitsito tiinidhii giigisade gaar ta unttana kiittida. Ta ye7ize wode yinna imota giigii betto. Ye wode yinna keehatitsi imota wolqqara maaqqikaayzin kadhera maaqqizanno erisane.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Hyanno tiirote; eerats budize eeratsi maxoda; gaama budize gaama maxoda. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Xoozii ufayssara inggize atstsa kadhize gisho wolqqara woy kadho baayzin maaqqikaayzin fettii fettii asi fa wozintte qoppidannigaara kadhera inggodes beezane. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Ubba wode ubba baza koshshize baz ubba denggi lo77o oocha ubba oochchodes dandda7ode fana Xoozii yinttis fa anjjito gantsoda. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">«E fa qolito dahuntsis lalida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">E xillotitsita medhinas yessada»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 9:9">yagaane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Maz. 112:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Budizes budutsi, maades katstsa inggize Laatstse, yin budize budutsito gaantsi inggoda. Yin xillotits aafton gantsoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">Isa. 55:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Gaama asuntsi yin inggize imotitsito nuuppa ekkii, Xooz galatode gaara, yin ubba wode gaantsi inggizuntsana maaqqade gaar Xoozii yinttana ubba bazara durissada. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Hyanna yin inggize imotta ammanze as facito kuntse xalaala maaqqikaayzin asuntsi Xooz galatodes mikinaate maaqqane. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Hyanna yin oochita yin ammantto ersi Kiristtoosa Wonggele yin ammanii ees kiitinttii yinttis yeze baz unttaran melluntsara shaakkinttide gisho ubbuntsi Xooz bonchchoda. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Xoozii yinttis inggide aadho keehatitsiti gisho un yinttis Xooz woossittera yinttana be7ades amudhdhane. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Wuzula baayze Xoozze imotitsitis Xoozii galatintto.<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa mootizuntsis mahide mahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Ta yinttara yeze wode aada, mahi yinttappa hyaakize wode nuulla afa minggane yaga7inttida, Phawuloosa, keehan ashkke maaqqide Kiristtoosa suntsite yinttana woossane. <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Taanii yinttago hyanggize wode nuna asho qofara hyanttize asi mahi qoppize asuntsalla afa mintsii qaalara ohinttodes qofa accida. Yinttalla afa yinnii gaara ohinttode gaar yin tana qoppaame fana yinttana woossane. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Nuunii hyanna sa7ite yezikon sa7a asi fana olinttoos. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Nu ola miishita hyanna sa7asito baaya. Yezin shuchchi ginbbito lalodes wolqqar yeze Xoozze toora. Turora olinttize lallen, <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>Xooz eraame gaar denddizuntsanan turira olinttize utura qofa ubba nu laloda. As qofa ubba di7i Kiristtoosas kiitinttode gaar nu yiissada. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Yin kiitinttizanna folo maaqqize wode nuunii kiitinttoosuntsana ubba seerodes giiginttoda.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Yin be7izanna balera benttize baz xalaala. Ooden fana Kiristtoosa baz ga7i qoppizebaz maaqqiko, nuunin Kiristtoosa baz maaqqizanno ero. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Laatstsii taas inggide adetits wolqqite ceeqinttikon yinne yeellidhoos. Yinna adetits wolqqita taas ingginttidanna yinttana dichchodes fattin lalodes baaya. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Taanii ta dabddaabbite yinttana yirggissades koyi xaafidebaz aazippe. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Fettii fettii asuntsi, «Phawuloosa dabddaabbita deexon wolqqaama, yezin E fa ommitis nuura yeze wode labitsi; E ohitan fatstsoos» yagaane. <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Yentsi asuntsi nu hyaako yezara xaafide dabddaabbize kale yinttara yezara oochchize oochiti gidda dummatitsi baayzanno qoppo.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Nuunii fana nashshize asuntsara nuna likkisades woy wolkkisades koyoos. Yezin un fana faara likkizii woy wolkkizii bi7itera eeya.<verse eid="2CO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Yezin nuunii Xoozii nuus inggide wuziltte ceeqinttoda fattin wuzula fiinggi ceeqinttoos; yinna wuzultta yinttagon yellane. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Nuunii koshshizannippa aatsii ceeqinttoos, yezin Kiristtoosa Wonggele tiinii yinttago yeltsidanne ceeqinttane. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Nuunii Xoozii esside wuzulappa fiinggi, melluntsi oochchide oochite ceeqinttoos. Maaqqoyezin, yin ammantta diccode fana Xoozii inggide wuzultte yin gidda nu oochchize oochita dalggoda ga7i qoppane. <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>Nuunii melle asi fa wuzultte oochchide oochite gelii ceeqinttoos, yezin yinttappa fiinggi melluntsis Wonggele markkidhades dandda7ane. <verse eid="2CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Yezin, Geeshi Maxaafite, «Ceeqqize ubba Laatstsalla ceeqqo» ga7i xaafinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Er. 9:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Laatstsii nashshize atstsa fattin fana faas nashshize atstse nashshinttoos.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosan worddo hawaaruntsin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Ta eerats eeyatitsito yin hyatten dandda7oda ga7i qoppane; aade dandda7ote. <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Xoozii yinttana buzo mahodes qoppidannigaara, taanin yinttis qoppane. Taanii yinttana geeshi wudurtigaara fettii dhiiratse, Kiristtoosas inggodes oocii gaddida.<verse eid="2CO 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Yezin shooshi fa genera Hewaano balitsidannifana oode erize yin wozintta iitii Kiristtoosas yeze yin suuretitsiton geeshshatitsito laamod yessane ga7i yirggane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-5">Medho 3:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Fettii asi yi7i, nuunii yinttis markkidhide Yesuusappa melle Yesuusa yinttis markkidhiko, woy yin ekkide Ayyaanzeppan Wonggelzeppan melle ayyaanan Wonggelen yinttis ohiko, si77i ga7i aatstsane.<verse eid="2CO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Yezin taanii Yesuusa «Damma hawaaruntsappa» laafane ga7i qoppoos. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Taanii ohe eroosse asi maaqqikon, eratitsi taas yene. Yinno ta yinttis gaama ogeran gaama bazara qonccizida.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Taanii miishe oocikaayzara Xoozze Wonggele yinttis hyarii ohidannan yinttana dhoqi yiizii tana toochidanna taas nagara maaqqane? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Taanii yinttis oochchodes melle woosa keetstsappa miishe bonqii ekkida. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Ta yinttara yeze wode tana madhikon yinttappa fettii asin waaysikaaya. Maqedooniyappa yi7ide ammanzuntsi tana koshshize baz ubba maaddida. Hyayno yellodes ta yinttis toofo maaqqikaaya tiinosin toofo maaqqoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Filph. 4:15-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Kiristtoosa turetitsita ta gidda yezin, ta ceeqito Akkaya gade tana ooden kayoos. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Ta hyanno akkos ga7e? Yinttana kadhoose gishosine? Taanii yinttana kadhizanno Xoozii erane.<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>«Nuunin yin fana oochchane» ga7i ceeqqize hyankko hawaaruntsi ceeqo mikinaato dhabssodes hyatte ta oochchizanno tiinosin oochchoda. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Hyannii gaarize asuntsi Kiristtoosa hawaare aazodes fana laammize worddanchcho hawaaruntsanan cimmize oochanchcho. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Yinna damma qofize baz baaya; akkos gayko, Xalahe foo7o kiitanchcho fana yi7ades fana laammane. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Yinnii gisho, Xalahe oochanchchuntsi xillotitsi oochanchcho fana yi7ades fana laammiko yinna damma baz baaya. Un wurssutsite fa oochitigaara ekkoda.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa yellide madha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Ooden tana eeya ga7i qoppaame fana mahi ohine. Ta yinttis eeya aazikon ta eeratsi ceeqinttode fana tana eeya mahi ekkote. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Taanii hyannigaara ceeqinttii ohize, Laatstse koyizannigaara maaqqikaayzin eeyatitsara ohine. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Gaama asuntsi hyanna sa7a bazite ceeqinttize gisho taanin ceeqinttoda. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Yin wozinaama maaqqide gisho eeya asi baz ufayssara dandda7ane. <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Ooden yinttana ariziko woy yinttana bonqiko woy faas maaddinttodes yinttago shiiqiko woy yinttalla afa uturtiko woy yinttana baqqiko yin dandda7ane. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Nuunii yinno oochchodes gaama booza maaqqizanno yeellidhittera ta ohine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Yezin ooden miinggi ceeqqinttiko, taanin ceeqqinttodes minggane. Taanii yinno eeya asi fana ohine. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Un Ibraawe? Taanin Ibraawe. Un Isra7eele? Taanin Isra7eele. Un Abrahama kochcho? Taanin Abrahama kochchi. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Un Kiristtoosa oochanchcho? Taanii zhashtize as gaar ohine, unttappa aadhize Kiristtoosa oochanchcho. Taanii oochara gaama labbida; gaama wode acinttida; garafinttida; gaama wode hyayqoppa attida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Hawa. 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Ayhuduntsi tana hyasttam uddufun ichchin tohe garafida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Mahe 25:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>Hyaydzdzii tohe gufera guuddinttida; fettii tohe shuchchara dhoginttida; markkabe hyaydzdzii tohe meqqida; abba gidda fettii qamma kumutsi aqii feezhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Hawa. 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:19">14:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Taanii gaama oge labbii yedhdhida. Kixa hyaatsappan faannoppa attida. Ayhuduntsin Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi taalla afa madha yeltsida. Katama, akko baayze ganasa, abba, tana zhashida; ammanze fana aazize asuntsi tana waytsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Hawa. 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Taanii oochara labbida cawida, gaama tohe gentto dhabida, naydhdhida, baridhdhida, cishtida, kallidhida.<verse eid="2CO 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Mellebaz ubba faydikaayzara ubba wode tana qofizanna woosa keetsi baz. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Fettii asi labbize wode eera ta labbika? Fettii asi nagarara dhubunttize wode ta ayde shenidhdhikaayzara ashshido?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Ta ceeqinttodes koshshize baz maaqqizako taanii labbida maaqqizanno erisize bazara ceeqinttoda. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Medhinas bonchchinttide Xoozze, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aday, ta worddidhoosanno erane. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Damasqqo katama Aretaasa gaaze kaatizeppa oomor ahize tana aytsodes koyi Damasqqo katama furtsito naagizane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Hawa. 9:23-25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>Yezin asuntsi tana daachcho gidda olii, katama shuchchi ginbbitis maskkootera ketstsin taanii E kushtippa attida.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa qonccitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Ceeqintte faatstsoossanno ta erane. Yezin ceeqinttodes koshshiko, Laatstsappa ekkide qonccitsite ceeqqoda. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Taphpho oyddii bereppa tiino, Kiristtoosa ammanze fettii atstse hyaydzintsa salo ekinttidanno ta erane. Ye atstse ashora woy asho baytsi qitezako ta eroos; Xoozii erane. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Ye atstse ekinttidanno erane. Yezin E ashora woy asho baytsi ekinttezako ta eroos; Xoozii erane. <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>Ye atstse gannate ekinttii asi qonccissadesin asi ohodes dandda7oosse baz si7ida. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Taanii ye atstsera ceeqinttoda, fattin taanii ta labitsito fattin ta gidda ceeqinttize bazi baaya. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Taanii turtto ohinttizanni gisho ceeqinttodes koykon eeya baaya. Yezin asi ta oochchizanno be7izannippan si7izannippa aatsii qoppaame gaar ga7i ceeqintte ashshane.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Taas qonccide damma qonccitsite ta uturtaame gaar tana waaysodes ta ashito zhulttize Xalahe kiitanchcho taas ingginttida. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Hyay waaytsizaya taappa hyaasode gaar taanii Laatstsa hyaydzdzii tohe woossida. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Yezin Laatstsii, «Ta wolqqita ne labitsitira qonccize gisho ta aadho keehatitsita nees maaqqada» gayda. Kiristtoosa wolqqita ta gidda qonccode gaar ta labitsite ufayttitera ceeqinttane. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Taanii Kiristtoosa gisho labbize wode, cazhinttize wode, waayinttize wode, bay7inttize wode, madhinttize wode ta labitsite ufayttane. Akkos gayko, ta labbize wode ye wode minggane.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa asuntsis qoppane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Taanii eeya asi fana ceeqinttida. Yinnii gaara ta ceeqinttode fana oochchide yinttana. Ta, ta ommite erinttoose asi maaqqikon, «Damma hawaaruntsana» ga7inttizuntsappa eeroos. Yinno taas markkidhades beezze yinttana yeshsha. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Ta yin gidda yezitera dandda7ara oochchide malla bazitan kille bazita ta turii hawaare maaqqidanno beezane. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Ta yinttis toofo maaqqikaayzara attidannippa melle woosa keetstsappa yin akkora eerido? Yinna bala maaqqiko tana maarote.<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Taanii yinttago hyammades giiginttodera hyanna taas hyaydzdzintsa. Ta yinttana fattin yinttis yeze baz koyoose gisho yinttana waaytsodes koyoos. Yeliduntsi fa na7untsis qolo minjjane fattin na7untsi fana yeliduntsis qolo minjjoos. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Ta yin gisho taas yezebaziton tanan aatsii inggikon tana ufayssane. Yeezin, taanii yinttana yinnii gaara aatsii siiqize wode yin tana eeratsi siiqane?<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Maaqqikon, ta yinttis toofo maaqqikaaya; waaytsikaaya; yezin yinttana cimmeran generan aykkidebaz yinttis aazikaayzara attaama. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Melle atto yezin, ta yinttago kiittide asuntsappa yinttana cimmide asi yene? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Tito yinttago qitode gaar taanii woossida; mahi ammanze isha eera dakkida. Yeezin, Tito yinttana cimmida? Nuunii nu oochito fettii ayyaanara oochchikaane? Mahi nu hyanttan fetto baane?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Nu ubba wode yin tiino nuna xillissades mootinttodebaz yinttis aazane? Nu Kiristtoosa gidda yezii Xoozze tiino hyanno yellodes ohine. Nu siiqo ishuntso, nu hyanno ubba oochchizanna yinttana dichchodes. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Ta yinttago hyanggize wode oode eride yin ta koyizannigaara yi7anxiko, mahi taanin yin koyizannigaara yi7i yellinttanxiko ga7i zhashitane. Mahi oode eride yin gidda lalle, qanaate, zhilo, fana kadhe, zigirssi, as sunts iisse, uturan kachchin yezanxi attaama ga7i zhashitane. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Taanii lam7intsa yinttago hyanggize wode Xoozii yin tiino tana yeellissada ga7i zhashitane. Zaga nagartto oochchii yinna fa oochchide tunatitsappa, olale hyanttafan yeellize oochappa maaqqikaayze asuntsana bi7i azzanikaayzara ashshoos ga7i zhashitane.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi zoren saritsen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Ta yinttago hyanggodera hyanna hyaydzintsa. Akko mooton lam77i woy hyaydzdzii markkara minggane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Mahe 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Taanii lam7intsa yinttara yellinttize wode yin gidda tiino nagara oochchide atstsan melluntsana ubba seerikaayzara ashshoos ga7i ohi gaddida. Hyatte ta hyaakkii yezikon maaqqii yinttago hyanggize wode oodesin yqsinttoos.<verse eid="2CO 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Ta gidda yezii ohize Kiristtoosa maaqqizanno yin erodes koyane. E yinttara ohinttize wode wolqqaama fattin yin gidda labitsi baaya. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Kiristtoosa masqalalla afa waayera suxinttida, yezin Xoozze wolqqite de7o yene. E labitsi maaqqizannigaara, nuunin labitsi. Yezin yinttana maaddades Xoozze wolqqite ezara de7o yessada.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Ammanora miinggi yezako yinttana yinttis fattanii bo7ote. Faatantte yin gol7anxi attiko, Kiristtoosa yin gidda yezanno yin erane. Yezin Kiristtoosa yinttara yezanxiko yin gol7oda. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Nuunii fatanara gol7aamanno yin erane ga7i nu ammanane.<verse eid="2CO 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Yin iita baz oochchaame fana nuunii Xooz woossane. Nuunii mintsii maaqqizanno asi be7ade fana maaqqikaayzin nuunii mintsii maaqqanxin, yin lo77o oochchode gaar nuunii woossane. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Nuunii turis oochchane fattin turira ixinttizebaz akko bazin oochchodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Nu labbize wode yin mahi miinggodera nuna ufayssane. Yin bore baayzuntsana maaqqade gaar nu yinttis Xooz woossane.<verse eid="2CO 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Taanii yinttappa hyaakkii yezitera xaafidanna yinnii gishos. Taanii yinttago hyanggize wode Laatstsii taas inggide adetitsi wolqqite ammaninttii yinttalla afa laatsidhades koyoos. Laatstsii taas wolqqa inggidanna, yinttana maaddodes fattin qohodes baaya.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Wurssutsite ta ishuntso, saro yezote. Bore baytsi yezote; ta zortto si7ote. Fettii wozinara maaqqii yezote; sarora yezote. Siiqon saro inggize Xoozze yinttara maaqqe.<verse eid="2CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Geeshi yeerintte yeerinttitera, fete feta saritsote. <verse eid="2CO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Xoozze asuntsi ubba yinttana saro saro yagaane.<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14"/>Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsi, Xoozze siiqo, Geeshi Ayyaana fettetitsi yin ubbuntsara maaqqe.<verse eid="2CO 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
